      "summary": "Model self-review found no blocking issues. Initiative finalization is explicit, active-only, and rejects unfinished work; continuation is limited to focused active unfinished authority and names credentials, destructive/irreversible operations, contract revision, blockers, and missing authorization as stop conditions; verification replacement retains exact tool-call binding; tests cover positive and negative lifecycle, inactive continuation, and stale observation recovery.",
